===Etymology===
First attested in 1677.  From {{term|alkali|lang=en}}, ultimately from {{etyl|ar|en}} {{term|قلي|القلي|tr=al-qaly|ashes of the [[saltwort]]|lang=ar}}, from {{term|قلى|tr=qalā||to roast in a pan, fry|lang=ar}}.

